MODEL WATCH #53 — Tuesday, September 8, 2026

1. ARGENT CUTS MID-TIER 25%; WHO MATCHES?
Argent Systems cut every 10–35B-class model by 25% this morning with no volume requirement. Current hosted prices for the models most of you run in production ($/M in / out):

  Model            Argent          Kestrel         Nimbus
  Sable-3 Mini     $0.11 / $0.44   $0.14 / $0.58   $0.14 / $0.58
  Quillon-L        $0.90 / $4.50   $1.20 / $6.00   $1.10 / $5.40
  Tanager-Coder 2  $0.23 / $0.68   $0.30 / $0.90   $0.30 / $0.90

We will update the table as others move.

2. SABLE-3 AGENT MODE
Server-side tool loop. On our 12-tool selection set it scores the same as calling Sable-3 in your own loop (96.0), so the gain is convenience, not accuracy. Trace format is proprietary; no mid-run interrupt.

3. OSTRAVA DOCUMENT MODEL ON KESTREL
$0.003 per page. On our procurement set: 92.8 field accuracy, slightly under Quillon-M (93.6) at 75% of the price. Handwriting remains weak for both.

4. PRICE CHANGES THIS WEEK
  Argent Systems, all 10–35B models: -25%
  Kestrel, Nimbus: no change (yet)
  Ostrava on Kestrel: new, $0.003/page

